__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
venv/
.venv/
.pytest_cache/

# Probe output. `probe --out` writes into the working directory by default,
# and a profile document carries the target's executable path, full command
# line, host names and window captions -- customer identifiers that have no
# business in version control.
# Any name an operator gives one: `profile*.json` missed dev-profile.json
# during iteration 2, which is exactly the near-miss this is guarding.
*profile*.json
# ...except the documented placeholder, which carries no real endpoint.
!docs/example-profile.json
